{"id":"u-331dfb7a-12e6-4cc7-a6c1-8ff2c0ec7472","src":"community","title":"Upper Lower: 2 Week Rotation Splits","author":"Bikram","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/fh0d6J-upper-lower-3-week-rotation-splits","desc":"This is a 4-day training program built on an Upper–Lower–Rest–Upper–Lower–Rest–Rest schedule, designed to maximize muscle growth, strength progression, and recovery efficiency.\n\nThis program uses a rotating priority system across a 2-week cycle, where each major upper body muscle group—chest, back, shoulders, and arms—receives dedicated neural priority without reducing overall training volume for other muscles.\n\nIt is ideal for novice to intermediate lifters focused on rebuilding muscle, improving physique balance, and achieving sustainable long-term hypertrophy.\n\nThe program runs on a repeating 2-week cycle:\n\nWeek 1\n- Upper Day 1 – Chest Priority\n- Upper Day 2 – Back Priority\n\nWeek 2\n- Upper Day 1 – Shoulder Priority\n- Upper Day 2 – Arms Priority\n\nLower body sessions (after each Upper Day) include 2 exercise variations in a week to ensure balanced development of quads, hamstrings, glutes and calf. Ab workouts are also includes in the lower body sessions.\n\nNo muscle group is deprioritized in total volume.","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-16T12:10:35.969Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest Focus","Lower 1","Back Focus","Lower 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Neutral Grip)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Wide-Grip Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":7.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7.5,"x":2}]